ion\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"[MCP: dashscope-vertical-search / poi_search] 搜索现实世界中的地点或商户。当用户想查找附近或指定区域内的餐馆、商店、景点、医院等地点，或按名称、类别、距离、营业状态等条件筛选地点时调用。不要用于一般知识、医疗知识或路线规划。\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"input_schema\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"object\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"properties\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"query\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"minLength\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"完整的地点搜索需求，包括位置范围和筛选条件（如已知）。\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"string\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"maxLength\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":500}},\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"required\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"query\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"additionalProperties\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":false}},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"mcp_dashscope-vertical-search_medical_search_f7aab4ac3bf4\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"[MCP: dashscope-vertical-search / medical_search] 检索医疗资料并回答健康问题。当用户询问症状、疾病、药物、检查、治疗、预防、营养或健康风险等医学信息时调用。不要用于搜索医院或诊所等地点；此类需求应调用 poi_search。本工具不能替代医生诊断或紧急医疗服务。\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"input_schema\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"object\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"properties\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"query\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"minLength\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"需要检索和回答的医疗或健康问题。\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\…[truncated]\"},\"rawResponse\":{\"status\":200,\"statusText\":\"OK\",\"headers\":{\"content-type\":\"text/event-stream;charset=UTF-8\",\"date\":\"Tue, 06 Oct 2026 05:55:22 GMT\",\"req-arrive-time\":\"1791266121604\",\"req-cost-time\":\"1231\",\"resp-start-time\":\"1791266122836\",\"server\":\"istio-envoy\",\"set-cookie\":\"[redacted]\",\"transfer-encoding\":\"chunked\",\"x-envoy-upstream-service-time\":\"1155\"},\"body\":\"event:ping\\ndata:{\\