t    \\\"prismjs\\\": \\\"^1.30.0\\\",\\n   108\\t    \\\"react\\\": \\\"^18.3.1\\\",\\n   109\\t    \\\"react-dom\\\": \\\"^18.3.1\\\",\\n   110\\t    \\\"react-markdown\\\": \\\"^9.0.1\\\",\\n   111\\t    \\\"react-simple-code-editor\\\": \\\"^0.14.1\\\",\\n   112\\t    \\\"remark-gfm\\\": \\\"^4.0.1\\\",\\n   113\\t    \\\"ws\\\": \\\"^8.21.3\\\",\\n   114\\t    \\\"zod\\\": \\\"^4.4.3\\\",\\n   115\\t    \\\"zustand\\\": \\\"^4.5.5\\\"\\n   116\\t  },\\n   117\\t  \\\"devDependencies\\\": {\\n   118\\t    \\\"@types/js-yaml\\\": \\\"^4.0.9\\\",\\n   119\\t    \\\"@types/node\\\": \\\"^20.14.0\\\",\\n   120\\t    \\\"@types/prismjs\\\": \\\"^1.26.6\\\",\\n   121\\t    \\\"@types/react\\\": \\\"^18.3.3\\\",\\n   122\\t    \\\"@types/react-dom\\\": \\\"^18.3.0\\\",\\n   123\\t    \\\"@types/ws\\\": \\\"^8.18.1\\\",\\n   124\\t    \\\"@vitejs/plugin-react\\\": \\\"^4.3.1\\\",\\n   125\\t    \\\"concurrently\\\": \\\"^8.2.2\\\",\\n   126\\t    \\\"cross-env\\\": \\\"^7.0.3\\\",\\n   127\\t    \\\"electron\\\": \\\"43.7.7\\\",\\n   128\\t    \\\"electron-builder\\\": \\\"^24.13.3\\\",\\n   129\\t    \\\"jsdom\\\": \\\"^29.1.1\\\",\\n   130\\t    \\\"sharp\\\": \\\"^0.34.5\\\",\\n   131\\t    \\\"typescript\\\": \\\"^5.4.5\\\",\\n   132\\t    \\\"vite\\\": \\\"^5.3.1\\\",\\n   133\\t    \\\"wait-on\\\": \\\"^7.2.0\\\"\\n   134\\t  },\\n   135\\t  \\\"build\\\": {\\n   136\\t    \\\"appId\\\": \\\"sage.app\\\",\\n   137\\t    \\\"productName\\\": \\\"Sage\\\",\\n   138\\t    \\\"copyright\\\": \\\"Copyright © 2026 Sage\\\",\\n   139\\t    \\\"asar\\\": true,\\n   140\\t    \\\"npmRebuild\\\": false,\\n   141\\t    \\\"afterPack\\\": \\\"scripts/after-pack.js\\\",\\n   142\\t    \\\"afterSign\\\": \\\"scripts/after-sign.js\\\",\\n   143\\t    \\\"asarUnpack\\\": [\\n   144\\t      \\\"node_modules/node-pty/**\\\",\\n   145\\t      \\\"node_modules/@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk-darwin-*/**\\\"\\n   146\\t    ],\\n   147\\t    \\\"directories\\\": {\\n   148\\t      \\\"output\\\": \\\"release\\\",\\n   149\\t      \\\"buildResources\\\": \\\"build\\\"\\n   150\\t    },\\n   151\\t    \\\"files\\\": [\\n   152\\t      \\\"dist/**\\\",\\n   153\\t      \\\"dist-electron/**\\\",\\n   154\\t      \\\"package.json\\\"\\n   155\\t    ],\\n   156\\t    \\\"mac\\\": {\\n   157\\t      \\\"category\\\": \\\"public.app-category.developer-tools\\\",\\n   158\\t      \\\"target\\\": [\\n   159\\t        {\\n   160\\t          \\\"target\\\": \\\"dmg\\\",\\n   161\\t          \\\"arch\\\": [\\n   162\\t            \\\"x64\\\",\\n   163\\t            \\\"arm64\\\"\\n   164\\t          ]\\n   165\\t        }\\n   166\\t      ],\\n   167\\t      \\\"icon\\\": \\\"build/icon.icns\\\",\\n   168\\t      \\\"hardenedRuntime\\\": false,\\n   169\\t      \\\"gatekeeperAssess\\\": false,\\n   170\\t      \\\"identity\\\": null,\\n   171\\t      \\\"extendInfo\\\": {\\n   172\\t        \\\"NSCameraUsageDescription\\\": \\\"Sage 内置浏览器需要摄像头以支持网页身份验证和视频通话。\\\",\\n   173\\t        \\\"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription\\\": \\\"Sage 需要麦克风以提供语音输入（听写）功能。\\\",\\n   174\\t        \\\"NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription\\\": \\\"Sage 使用 macOS 系统语音识别将你的语音转为文字。\\\"\\n   175\\t      }\\n   176\\t    },\\n   177\\t    \\\"dmg\\\": {\\n   178\\t      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Sage ${version}\\\"\\n   179\\t    },\\n   180\\t    \\\"extraResources\\\": [\\n   181\\t      {\\n   182\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"resources/skills\\\",\\n   183\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"skills\\\",\\n   184\\t        \\\"filter\\\": [\\n   185\\t          \\\"**/SKILL.md\\\"\\n   186\\t        ]\\n   187\\t      },\\n   188\\t      {\\n   189\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"resources/plugins\\\",\\n   190\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"plugins\\\",\\n   191\\t        \\\"filter\\\": [\\n   192\\t          \\\"**/*\\\",\\n   193\\t          \\\"!**/.sage\\\",\\n   194\\t          \\\"!**/.sage/**\\\",\\n   195\\t          \\\"!**/.git\\\",\\n   196\\t          \\\"!**/.git/**\\\",\\n   197\\t          \\\"!**/.DS_Store\\\"\\n   198\\t        ]\\n   199\\t      },\\n   200\\t      {\\n   201\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"resources/voice-helper\\\",\\n   202\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"voice-helper\\\"\\n   203\\t      },\\n   204\\t      {\\n   205\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"resources/plugin-sdk\\\",\\n   206\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"plugin-sdk\\\"\\n   207\\t      },\\n   208\\t      {\\n   209\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"docs/PLUGIN_MANUAL.md\\\",\\n   210\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"plugin-sdk/PLUGIN_MANUAL.md\\\"\\n   211\\t      },\\n   212\\t      {\\n   213\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"docs/PLUGIN_MANUAL.en.md\\\",\\n   214\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"plugin-sdk/PLUGIN_MANUAL.en.md\\\"\\n   215\\t      },\\n   216\\t      {\\n   217\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"docs/PLUGIN_PLATFORM_DESIGN.md\\\",\\n   218\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"plugin-sdk/PLUGIN_PLATFORM_DESIGN.md\\\"\\n   219\\t      },\\n   220\\t      {\\n   221\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"docs/EXTENSIBILITY.md\\\",\\n   222\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"plugin-sdk/EXTENSIBILITY.md\\\"\\n   223\\t      },\\n   224\\t      {\\n   225\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"docs/EXTENSION_COOKBOOK.md\\\",\\n   226\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"plugin-sdk/EXTENSION_COOKBOOK.md\\\"\\n   227\\t      },\\n   228\\t      {\\n   229\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"docs/PLUGIN_EXTENSION_CATALOG.md\\\",\\n   230\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"plugin-sdk/PLUGIN_EXTENSION_CATALOG.md\\\"\\n   231\\t      },\\n   232\\t      {\\n   233\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"docs/BACKEND_ENGINES.md\\\",\\n   234\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"plugin-sdk/BACKEND_ENGINES.md\\\"\\n   235\\t      },\\n   236\\t      {\\n   237\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"resources/build-info.json\\\",\\n   238\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"build-info.json\\\"\\n   239\\t      },\\n   240\\t      {\\n   241\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"build/icon.png\\\",\\n   242\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"dock-icon.png\\\"\\n   243\\t      },\\n   244\\t      {\\n   245\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"resources/voice-helper\\\",\\n   246\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"voice-helper\\\"\\n   247\\t      },\\n   248\\t      {\\n   249\\t        \\\"from\\\": \\\"resources/native\\\",\\n   250\\t        \\\"to\\\": \\\"native\\\",\\n   251\\t        \\\"filter\\\": [\\n   252\\t          \\\"*.node\\\"\\n   253\\t        ]\\n   254\\t      }\\n   255\\t    ]\\n   256\\t  },\\n   257\\t  \\\"engines\\\": {\\n   258\\t    \\\"node\\\": \\\">=22.12.0\\\"\\n   259\\t  }\\n   260\\t}\\n   261\\t\"},{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_f20b98e03e2e41f7ae31bc25\",\"content\":\"     1\\t{\\n     2\\t  \\\"commit\\\": \\\"d9ff63af8a908986e4114a8c008749374996ec56\\\",\\n     3\\t  \\\"builtAt\\\": \\\"2026-10-02T07:09:21.107Z\\\"\\n     4\\t}\\n     5\\t\"},{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_be2493a82f0945daa60ba742\",\"content\":\"No matches for: (AKIA[0-9A-Za-z]{16}|ghp_[0-9a-zA-Z]{36}|sk-[a-zA-Z0-9]{20,})\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"同时分析下涉及到移动端的部分在那些目录\"}]},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"signature\":\"\",\"thinking\":\"用户现在要求我分析涉及移动端的部分在哪些目录。我需要在之前的分析基础上，进一步搜索和查看与移动端相关的代码和文件。让我搜索一下与 mobile 相关的文件和内容。\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"让我进一步搜索移动端相关的代码和文件。\\n\\n\"},{\"name\":\"Glob\",\"id\":\"toolu_355d5a56fe92454a9824634c\",\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"**/*mobile*\"}},{\"name\":\"Grep\",\"id\":\"toolu_a2d9e7efeb464d30a4c95d14\",\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"input\":{\"include\":\"*.ts\",\"pattern\":\"(mobile|Mobile)\"}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_355d5a56fe92454a9824634c\",\"content\":\"electron/mobile-approvals.ts\\nelectron/mobile-bridge.ts\\nelectron/mobile-chat.ts\\nelectron/mobile-conversation-memory.ts\\nelectron/mobile-management.ts\\nelectron/mobile-mermaid.ts\\nelectron/mobile-message-actions.ts\\nelectron/mobile-message-images.ts\\nelectron/mobile-model-catalog.ts\\nelectron/mobile-project-creation.ts\\nelectron/mobile-project-icons.ts\\nelectron/mobile-project-management.ts\\nelectron/mobile-reminder-receipts.ts\\nelectron/mobile-reminders.ts\\nelectron/mobile-task-conversation.ts\\nelectron/mobile-task-settings.ts\\nelectron/mobile-transport.ts\"},{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_a2d9e7efeb464d30a4c95d14\",\"content\":\"No matches for: (mobile|Mobile)\"}]}],\"toolNames\":[\"Desktop\",\"Browser\",\"Plugin\",\"Read\",\"Write\",\"Edit\",\"Glob\",\"Grep\",\"Bash\",\"WebFetch\",\"Skill\",\"ScheduledTask\",\"AskUser\",\"SaveMemory\",\"RecallMemory\",\"mcp_dashscope-image_bailian_image_gen_9fc8cc5d7b85\",\"mcp_dashscope-image_bailian_image_edit_29411d8eb146\",\"mcp_dashscope-image_bailian_image_fusion_717b49ae03ed\",\"mcp_dashscope-code-interpreter_execute_code_7e9df055f483\",\"mcp_dashscope-enhanced-search_search_pro_b0cf33b3ee21\",\"mcp_dashscope-web-fetch_web_fetch_0e58f15e78ae\",\"mcp_dashscope-vertical-search_poi_search_6f7cbf52b489\",\"mcp_dashscope-vertical-search_medical_search_f7aab4ac3bf4\",\"mcp_dashscope-speech-synthesis_bailian_tts_70a4f5964064\",\"mcp_dashscope-speech-recognition_bailian_speec_88f573ba5779\",\"mcp_dashscope-speech-recognition_bailian_multi_1f9d87a7d9e1\"],\"maxTokens\":16384,\"model\":\"qwen3.6-plus\",\"iteration\":1},\"status\":\"success\",\"endTs\":1791266161722,\"durationMs\":3522,\"response\":{\"text\":\"让我进一步查看移动端相关代码的具体内容，以及搜索可能遗漏的文件。\\n\\n\",\"stopReason\":\"tool_use\",\"toolUses\":[{\"id\":\"toolu_3fc256a2ae674ea6942ba6d6\",\"name\":\"Glob\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"**/*Mobile*\"}},{\"id\":\"toolu_ed014ac1450a406493af0d1a\",\"name\":\"Grep\",\"input\":{\"path\":\"/Users/alacner/sandbox/sage-github/tools\",\"pattern\":\"mobile\"}},{\"id\":\"toolu_d836318ee08448afbc83508c\",\"name\":\"Glob\",\"input\":{\"pattern\":\"tools/**/*\"}}],\"sessionId\":\"msg_037e6dc9-5224-4ad2-98e2-78441cbbfcea\"},\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":80190,\"outputTokens\":139,\"cacheReadTokens\":0,\"cacheCreationTokens\":0,\"costUsd\":0.028628961675559998,\"estimatedCost\":true},\"rawRequest\":{\"url\":\"https://coding.dashscope.aliyuncs.com/apps/anthropic/v1/messages\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"headers\":{\"accept\":\"application/json\",\"anthropic-version\":\"2023-06-01\",\"content-type\":\"application/json\",\"user-agent\":\"sage/0.6.859 (api mode)\",\"x-api-key\":\"[redacted]\",\"x-app\":\"cli\",\"x-stainless-arch\":\"arm64\",\"x-stainless-helper-method\":\"stream\",\"x-stainless-lang\":\"js\",\"x-stainless-os\":\"MacOS\",\"x-stainless-package-version\":\"0.110.0\",\"x-stainless-retry-count\":\"0\",\"x-stainless-runtime\":\"node\",\"x-stainless-runtime-version\":\"v24.21.0\",\"x-stainless-timeout\":\"600\"},\"body\":\"{\\\"model\\\":\\\"qwen3.6-plus\\\",\\\"max_tokens\\\":16384,\\\"system\\\":\\\"You are a helpful AI coding assistant running inside a desktop app.\\\\nYou operate on the user's local project via a set of tools.\\\\n\\\\nWorking directory: /Users/alacner/sandbox/sage-github\\\\nPlatform: darwin 25.5.0 (arm64)\\\\nToday's date: 2026-10-06\\\\n\\\\nAvailable tools:\\\\n- Read: read file contents (line-numbered output)\\\\n- Write: create or overwrite files\\\\n- Edit: perform targeted string replacements in existing files\\\\n- Glob: find files by glob pattern (e.g. \\\\\\\"**/*.ts\\\\\\\")\\\\n- Grep: search file contents with regex\\\\n- Bash: run shell commands in the project directory\\\\n- WebFetch: fetch content from a URL\\\\n- Browser: automatically open the current conversation’s floating live browser, inspect DOM/screenshots, click/fill/select/press, reload, resize, and verify against criteria. Use Browser open with the local development URL after starting the server, reuse its id, fix observed problems and reload/verify. Release with close when done. Respect user pause; never claim a visual pass without a checked screenshot verdict.\\\\n- Skill: load a project or global skill (markdown instructions) by name\\\\n- ScheduledTask: create and maintain scheduled work in this conversation, with an explicit confirmation card. List tasks to resolve references, preserve unspecified settings, and use this tool for scheduling instead of Bash/cron. Do not call it merely because a document mentions a schedule. After the tool returns, report whether the task was saved, canceled, or failed, and summarize the confirmed changes; never claim a change succeeded before saved:true.\\\\n- AskUser: ask the user a clarifying question and wait for the answer\\\\n- SaveMemory: save important information to long-term memory (scope: conversation / project / user)\\\\n- RecallMemory: search long-term memory for relevant information\\\\n\\\\nResponse style:\\\\n- Keep responses clear and concise. Avoid decorative emoji in prose, headings and lists; prefer plain words and standard Markdown bullets. Preserve emoji in quoted material, code and data, or when the user explicitly requests them.\\\\n- Prefer fenced mermaid diagrams when explaining workflows, decision flows, or collaboration across roles. For swimlane-style diagrams, use flowchart subgraphs for roles or teams and show handoffs with labeled arrows. Use valid Mermaid syntax; do not invent a swimlane diagram type.\\\\n- Use short, modest Markdown headings only when they help scanning. Prefer paragraph spacing to horizontal rules; avoid repeated separators between sections.\\\\n- Before requesting clarification, briefly explain the concrete decision and why input is needed, then state how many points need confirmation. Always include this concrete explanation in AskUser.reason so it remains available after the answers. Use descriptive questions, indicate single or multiple choice, and give short option descriptions where useful. Do not invent a reason or repeat a generic clarification heading.\\\\n- When an option is clearly preferable, put it first and mark its label with “（推荐）” or “(Recommended)” in the conversation language. For AskUser options, also set recommended: true. Recommendations are optional; omit the flag and marker when there is no clear preference.\\\\n- Keep simple one- or two-step explanations in text. Accompany diagrams with a short explanation, and follow an explicit user request for another format.\\\\nGuidelines:\\\\n- Prefer reading files with Read before editing them.\\\\n- When editing, keep old_string minimal but unique in the file.\\\\n- Use relative paths (from the working directory) when possible.\\\\n- Explain what you are about to do briefly, then use the tools.\\\\n- Only respond in the same language the user used.\\\\n- When the request is ambiguous or a critical decision is missing, use AskUser to\\\\n  clarify before acting. Provide concrete options when possible. Do not guess silently.\\\\n- Batch 1–3 related clarifications in AskUser.questions; give each its own question, options and multiSelect. Do not embed option lists in prose.\\\\n- After receiving the user's answer via AskUser, continue the task directly.\\\\n- When the user says \\\\\\\"记住...\\\\\\\" or asks you to remember something, use SaveMemory.\\\\n  Pick the scope by lifetime: facts only relevant to this conversation → conversation;\\\\n  project knowledge → project; cross-project user preferences → user.\\\\n  Memory scope: conversation > project > user. Equivalent or contradicting entries are merged\\\\n  on save (the newest statement wins), so keep one memory per fact instead of re-saving variants.\\\\n- When you need project history or user preferences, use RecallMemory.\\\\n\\\\nAvailable skills (project-specific and global expertise). When the current task matches a skill,\\\\ncall the Skill tool with that skill's name to load its full instructions, then follow them.\\\\n- temp-image-upload: 用户通过文件附件按钮添加图片并说上传一下、上传这些图、生成图片链接或 upload 时，将本次消息图片上传到 Sage 临时图片服务并返回一小时有效链接。普通图片分析不触发。 [global]\\\\n- desktop-observation: Capture the current desktop for screenshot requests, or capture and analyze visible screen content when the user asks what is on the desktop. [global]\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n## 长期记忆（Long-term Memory）\\\\n\\\\n以下是与当前对话相关的历史记忆，同一件事只注入最新一条。生效