op\\ndata:{\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_stop\\\",\\\"index\\\":1}\\n\\nevent:content_block_start\\ndata:{\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_start\\\",\\\"content_block\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Read\\\",\\\"input\\\":{},\\\"id\\\":\\\"toolu_95f5d8a3dc6849efb782f365\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_use\\\"},\\\"index\\\":2}\\n\\nevent:content_block_delta\\ndata:{\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"partial_json\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_json_delta\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":2}\\n\\nevent:content_block_delta\\ndata:{\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"partial_json\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"file_path\\\\\\\": \\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_json_delta\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":2}\\n\\nevent:content_block_delta\\ndata:{\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"partial_json\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"/Users/alac\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_json_delta\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":2}\\n\\nevent:content_block_delta\\ndata:{\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"partial_json\\\":\\\"ner/sandbox/s\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_json_delta\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":2}\\n\\nevent:content_block_delta\\ndata:{\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"partial_json\\\":\\\"age-github/e\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_json_delta\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":2}\\n\\nevent:content_block_delta\\ndata:{\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"partial_json\\\":\\\"lectron/mobile-bridge\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_json_delta\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":2}\\n\\nevent:content_block_delta\\ndata:{\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"partial_json\\\":\\\".ts\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_json_delta\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":2}\\n\\nevent:content_block_delta\\ndata:{\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"partial_json\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_json_delta\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":2}\\n\\nevent:content_block_delta\\ndata:{\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"partial_json\\\":\\\"}\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_json_delta\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":2}\\n\\nevent:content_block_stop\\ndata:{\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_stop\\\",\\\"index\\\":2}\\n\\nevent:content_block_start\\ndata:{\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_start\\\",\\\"content_block\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"input\\\":{},\\\"id\\\":\\\"toolu_fecf4a0be7f94b89b285984e\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_use\\\"},\\\"index\\\":3}\\n\\nevent:content_block_delta\\ndata:{\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"partial_json\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_json_delta\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":3}\\n\\nevent:content_block_delta\\ndata:{\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"partial_json\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pattern\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"mobile\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_json_delta\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":3}\\n\\nevent:content_block_delta\\ndata:{\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"partial_json\\\":\\\"\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_json_delta\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":3}\\n\\nevent:content_block_delta\\ndata:{\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"partial_json\\\":\\\"}\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_json_delta\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_delta\\\",\\\"index\\\":3}\\n\\nevent:content_block_stop\\ndata:{\\\"type\\\":\\\"content_block_stop\\\",\\\"index\\\":3}\\n\\nevent:message_delta\\ndata:{\\\"delta\\\":{\\\"stop_reason\\\":\\\"tool_use\\\"},\\\"type\\\":\\\"message_delta\\\",\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"output_tokens\\\":114,\\\"cache_creation_input_tokens\\\":0,\\\"input_tokens\\\":80519,\\\"cache_read_input_tokens\\\":0}}\\n\\nevent:message_stop\\ndata:{\\\"type\\\":\\\"message_stop\\\"}\\n\\n\"}}\ndocs/HELP.en.md:266:## Models and settings in mobile conversations\ndocs/HELP.en.md:268:In the mobile conversation's “+ → Model and reasoning effort”, “Use project / global default” shows the inherited provider, model name and source. Restoring the default keeps inheritance instead of pinning the parent's current model. Composite and routed providers show their configured public model name; downstream members are still selected per request.\ndocs/HELP.en.md:270:Matching desktop and mobile version 0.6.849 lets you change the model, reasoning effort and conversation security profile while a reply runs. Saved changes apply to the next turn, including the next queued message. The current reply, tools, interjection continuations and expert tasks keep their starting settings. Full access still requires confirmation. Older desktops remain read-only during execution and explain the upgrade; the relay forwards existing operations and does not need a simultaneous upgrade.\ndocs/HELP.en.md:437:Install the bundled browser acceptance skill, enable Browser and the skill package, and configure a vision model. It uses actual screenshots, DOM checks, desktop/mobile viewports and integrated project tabs. A missing vision model cannot produce a visual pass.\ndocs/HELP.en.md:1033:<a id=\"mobile-intro\"></a>\ndocs/HELP.zh-CN.md:1033:<a id=\"mobile-intro\"></a>\ndocs/README.md:21:| Android / iPhone 移动端 | [移动端界面、持久登录与构建安装](mobile/README.md) / [对话、计划与授权](mobile/CHAT_EXPERIENCE.md) / [手机管理协议](mobile/SETTINGS_API.md) |\ndocs/README.md:22:| iPhone 源码包与 Xcode 构建 | [准备 Pods、Codegen、workspace 和缺失依赖检查](mobile/IOS_BUILD.md) |\ndocs/README.md:23:| Android 自动更新与网站更新包 | [Android 更新流程和发布](mobile/ANDROID_UPDATES.md) |\ndocs/README.md:24:| 移动端 Markdown 图表 | [Android / iOS 离线 Mermaid、主题与全屏预览](mobile/MERMAID.md) |\ndocs/README.md:41:- [移动端语言、外观顺序与对话输入交互](mobile/INTERFACE.md)\ndocs/README.md:42:- [移动端三版设计比较与精修](mobile/design/REVIEW.md) / [实现范围](mobile/VISUAL_REFINEMENT.md)\ndocs/README.md:133:- [移动端体验](mobile/EXPERIENCE.md)\ndocs/README.md:135:- [移动端模型目录与旧桌面兼容](mobile/MODEL_CATALOG.md)\ndocs/archive/MOBILE_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md:9:   - `/mobile/auth` API - 验证客户端状态\ndocs/archive/MOBILE_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md:10:   - `/mobile/command` API - 转发指令到客户端\ndocs/archive/MOBILE_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md:11:   - `/mobile/ws` WebSocket - 移动端事件推送\ndocs/archive/MOBILE_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md:12:   - `mobile_co