AMES.md:9:桌面、Android 和 iOS 使用相同的名称规则。维护源为 `shared/tool-display-name.ts`；移动端随源码包包含生成的副本，保持独立构建能力。修改规则后运行 `node scripts/sync-mobile-tool-display.cjs`，再用 `npm run test:tool-display-name` 检查同步和桌面显示，移动端运行 `npm test`。\ndocs/help/AUTHORING.md:28:| 7 | 自动化与渠道 / Automation & channels | scheduled-intro, scheduled-authorization, channels-intro, channels-feishu, channels-relay, mobile-intro |\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:31:import { handleMobileCommand } from '../mobile-bridge';\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:66:let mobileOnline = 0;\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:69:let mobileStatusTimer: ReturnType<typeof setInterval> | null = null;\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:70:let mobileStatusRequest: AbortController | null = null;\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:71:let mobileStatusTimeout: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout> | null = null;\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:121:  try { ws.send(JSON.stringify({ type: 'mobile_event', channel: 'reminders.changed', data: {}, ts: Date.now() })); }\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:135:    mobileOnline = 0;\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:278:    // 来源：移动端 App 通过 relay 下发的 mobile_command\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:279:    if (msg.type === 'mobile_command' && typeof msg.requestId === 'string') {\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:346: * 调用 mobile-bridge 分发执行，把结果回传给 relay（由 relay 转发到移动端）。\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:360:        type: 'mobile_response',\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:366:        if (!error && result.afterReply) void result.afterReply().catch(() => { console.error('[relay-client] mobile post-response operation failed'); });\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:369:      console.error('[relay-client] mobile_response send failed:', err);\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:412:  mobileStatusTimer = setInterval(refresh, MOBILE_STATUS_INTERVAL);\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:416:  if (mobileStatusTimer) clearInterval(mobileStatusTimer);\nelectron/channels/relay-client.ts:417:  mobileStatusTime